2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Isodata\054\040a\040novel\040method\040of\040data\040analysis\040and\040pattern\040classification)
/Author (Geoffrey\040H\056\040Ball\054\040David\040J\056\040Hall)
/Subject (\072\040ISODATA\054\040a\040novel\040method\040of\040data\040analysis\040and\040pattern\040classification\054\040is\040described\040in\040verbal\040and\040pictorial\040terms\054\040in\040terms\040of\040a\040two\055dimensional\040example\054\040and\040by\040giving\040the\040mathematical\040calculations\040that\040the\040method\040uses\056\040The\040technique\040clusters\040many\055variable\040data\040around\040points\040in\040the\040data\047s\040original\040high\055\040dimensional\040space\040and\040by\040doing\040so\040provides\040a\040useful\040description\040of\040the\040data\056\040A\040brief\040summary\040of\040results\040from\040analyzing\040alphanumeric\054\040gaussian\054\040sociological\040and\040meteorological\040data\040is\040given\056\040In\040the\040appendix\054\040generalizations\040of\040the\040existing\040technique\040to\040clustering\040around\040lines\040and\040planes\040are\040discussed\040and\040a\040tentative\040algorithm\040for\040clustering\040around\040lines\040is\040given\056)
/Keywords (01\040Apr\0401965\054\040Cluster\040analysis)
>>
endobj
